wrote:

> I'm getting sick of changing the options everytime I start a new game
> (killed two dozen rogues so far...).  Any way to save the options so
> next time I die and start a new game, the options I set is still
> there?

You can't save the options while a game is underway, but you can set
personal defaults in a file in your home directory, loaded every time
you start a game. This is called .nethackrc on Unixy systems, and I
think defaults.nh on Windows.

If you're still baffled, feel free to mail me.

